WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
Hi, it's Dr. Salas. Your procedure is one week away so it's a great time to get

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.560
a few things in

3
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.130
order. First, pick up your bowel prep kit from the pharmacy if you haven't

4
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:09.440
already. Secondly,

5
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.320
make sure you have a responsible adult lined up to drive you home. You won't be

6
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:13.920
able to drive

7
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.940
yourself after the procedure. Also, stock your fridge with clear liquids, water

8
00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:19.840
, broth, clear

9
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:24.630
juices, and popsicles. Starting now, begin shifting to a low-fiber diet, cut

10
00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.720
back on raw vegetables,

11
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.920
whole grains, nuts, and seeds. And lastly, take a moment to review your current

12
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.640
medications.

13
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:37.760
If you take blood thinners, iron supplements, or diabetes medications, we have

14
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:38.640
specific guidance

15
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.260
for each of those in the next few videos. As always, if anything comes up, don't

16
00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:43.840
hesitate

17
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:47.680
to reach out to your doctor's office. You're off to a great start.
